# Deny by default (design.md § Images and TLS; AD-112): an image gets only what the Render install and the API need. A new
# top-level entry stays out of every build context until it is named below.
*

# The workspace: the root manifests and the lockfile, the API with every package it imports, and the manifests of the other
# workspace packages, which the frozen install reads.
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/api
!apps/web/package.json
!apps/agent/package.json
!packages
!tests/acceptance/package.json

# Excluded again, after every re-inclusion: environment files, key material and installed dependencies.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
